{title: Power In The Blood}
{key: Bb}
{x_theme: blood, cross, praise, victory}
{x_source: chrd:power_in_the_blood.chrd}

{comment: Refrain}
[Bb]There is pow'r, pow'r, [Cm]wonder [Eb]working [Bb]pow'r
[F]In the [F7]blood of the [Bb]Lamb;
There is pow'r, pow'r, [Cm7]wonder [Eb]working [Bb]pow'r
[F]In the [F7]precious [Bb]blood [F7]of the [Bb]Lamb.

{comment: Verse 1}
[Bb]Would you be free from the [Eb]burden of [Bb]sin?
There's [F]pow'r in the blood, [Bb]pow'r in the blood;
Would you o'er evil a [Eb]victory [Bb]win?
There's [F]wonderful [F7]pow'r in the [Bb]blood.

{comment: Verse 2}
[Bb]Would you be free from your passion and pride?
There's [F]pow'r in the blood, [Bb]pow'r in the blood;
Come for a cleansing at [Eb]Calvary's [Bb]tide?
There's [F]wonderful [F7]pow'r in the [Bb]blood.

{comment: Verse 3}
[Bb]Would you do service for [E]Jesus your [Bb]King?
There's [F]pow'r in the blood, [Bb]pow'r in the blood;
Would you live baily His [Eb]praises to [Bb]sing?
There's [F]wonderful [F7]pow'r in the [Bb]blood.
